grid: return OutOfMemory from AlignedGrid::with_alloc_tracker when width * height or the aligned
buffer length overflows usize, instead of expect("grid dimensions overflow usize"). Reachable on
32-bit targets. Test: grid_dimension_overflow
(crates/jxl-oxide-tests/tests/grid_dimension_overflow.rs). The input only fails on 32-bit targets
(upstream CI runs the tests on armv7).

Upstream: not reported; the code is unchanged at upstream HEAD (c0cc4c7, 2026-08-15).

